- Run Python unit tests for the agent extraction logic using mocked web search responses.
- Verify Langfuse traces are generated upon API calls.

### Manual Verification
- `docker-compose up --build` successfully starts all three services.
- Click "Refresh" on the frontend TopBar.
- Check backend logs to see agents running in parallel.
- Verify new records appear in the "Staging Dashboard" on the frontend.
- Approve a record and verify the corresponding `.csv` file in `public/data` is updated correctly.
- Verify the 6 PM IST cron job triggers appropriately.
